WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.350
Eddy drove toward his friends.

2
00:00:16.351 --> 00:00:27.076
He felt awful.

3
00:00:27.077 --> 00:00:30.580
Zippy flew past Eddy.

4
00:00:30.581 --> 00:00:34.140
"I made the team!" Zippy shouted.

5
00:00:34.141 --> 00:00:39.595
"And Eddy didn't!"

6
00:00:39.596 --> 00:00:46.108
Poppy looked at Eddy.

7
00:00:46.109 --> 00:00:56.042
She whispered to Dipper and Jeb.

8
00:00:56.043 --> 00:00:58.945
The three of them raced away.

9
00:00:58.946 --> 00:01:02.088
They drove behind the garage.

10
00:01:02.089 --> 00:01:04.960
Eddy gasped.

11
00:01:04.961 --> 00:01:09.754
"My friends don't like me anymore!" he thought.

12
00:01:09.755 --> 00:01:12.762
Eddy grew angry.

13
00:01:12.763 --> 00:01:15.919
"They're mean!" he thought.

14
00:01:15.920 --> 00:01:19.179
"I'll tell them that!"

15
00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:22.417
Eddy drove behind the garage.

16
00:01:22.418 --> 00:01:26.252
"Surprise!" shouted Poppy.

17
00:01:26.253 --> 00:01:28.780
"Huh?" said Eddy.

18
00:01:28.781 --> 00:01:32.050
Poppy stuck a sticker on Eddy.

19
00:01:32.051 --> 00:01:35.305
"There!" she said.

20
00:01:35.306 --> 00:01:38.311
"Now you're on a team!"

21
00:01:38.312 --> 00:01:41.048
"What team?" asked Eddy.

22
00:01:41.049 --> 00:01:44.385
"Our team!" said Dipper.

23
00:01:44.386 --> 00:01:51.235
"It's a friends' team!" said Jeb.

24
00:01:51.236 --> 00:01:54.937
Eddy grinned.

25
00:01:54.938 --> 00:02:08.897
It was the best team ever.

